# ==========================================
# MAILTRAP CONFIGURATION (Development)
# ==========================================
# 
# Gunakan Mailtrap (https://mailtrap.io/) untuk testing email di local development
#
# Langkah setup:
# 1. Buat akun gratis di https://mailtrap.io/
# 2. Buat project baru, pilih "Integrations" > Laravel
# 3. Copy SMTP credentials dari Mailtrap
# 4. Paste di .env Anda seperti di bawah:
#
# MAIL_MAILER=smtp
# MAIL_HOST=live.smtp.mailtrap.io
# MAIL_PORT=587
# MAIL_USERNAME=your-username@mailtrap.io
# MAIL_PASSWORD=your-api-token
# MAIL_ENCRYPTION=tls
# MAIL_FROM_ADDRESS=noreply@loyalty.local
# MAIL_FROM_NAME="Khanaan Loyalty"
#
# Catatan untuk production:
# - Gunakan SendGrid, AWS SES, atau mail server sendiri
# - Ganti MAIL_HOST, MAIL_PORT, MAIL_USERNAME, MAIL_PASSWORD dengan settings production
# ==========================================
